<title>ST VINCENT: Cricket-West Indies v Sri Lanka scoreboard.</title>
<headline>Cricket-West Indies v Sri Lanka scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fifth and last day of the second and final test between West Indies and Sri Lanka at Arnos Vale which ended on Tuesday:</p>
<p>West Indies 1st innings 147 (C.Hooper 81; R.Pushpakumara 5-41)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka 1st innings 222 (S.Jayasuriya 90; C.Hooper 5-26)</p>
<p>West Indies 2nd innings 343 (B.Lara 113; M.Muralitharan 5-113)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka 2nd innings (overnight 97-2): S.Jayasuriya b Walsh		     17</p>
<p>R.Mahanama c Browne b Bishop	   29</p>
<p>M.Atapattu b Walsh			 10</p>
<p>A.de Silva b Walsh			 78</p>
<p>A.Ranatunga not out			72</p>
<p>R.Kaluwitharana hit wkt b Walsh	 2</p>
<p>S.Ranatunga run out			 0</p>
<p>K.Dharmasena c Browne b Ambrose	 7</p>
<p>M.Muralitharan c Holder b Ambrose     0</p>
<p>S.de Silva not out			  1</p>
<p>Extras (lb-3 nb-14)			17</p>
<p>Total (for eight wickets)	     233</p>
<p>Did not bat: R.Pushpakumara.</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-26 2-55 3-118 4-189 5-193 6-208 7-231 8-231.</p>
<p>Bowling: Ambrose 15-1-51-2 (nb7), Walsh 24-2-73-4 (nb5), Rose 6-0-24-0 (nb2), Bishop 14-1-61-1, Hooper 9-3-21-0.</p>
<p>Result: match drawn.</p>
<p>First test in antigua - West Indies won by six wickets.</p>
</text>
